   "name": "Asset Repair-why_why_help",
   "options": "<style>.ua-ww{margin-bottom:var(--margin-md,16px)}.ua-ww-steps{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ua-ww-step{flex:1 1 170px;min-width:160px;background:var(--card-bg,var(--fg-color));border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:var(--border-radius-md,8px);padding:12px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}.ua-ww-step:hover,.ua-ww-step:focus-visible{border-color:var(--primary);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);outline:none}.ua-ww-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px}.ua-ww-num{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);color:var(--neutral-white,#fff);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}.ua-ww-icon{color:var(--primary);display:inline-flex}.ua-ww-title{font-weight:600;color:var(--heading-color,var(--text-color));margin-bottom:2px}.ua-ww-text{color:var(--text-muted);font-size:var(--text-sm,12px);line-height:1.5}.ua-ww-arrow{align-self:center;color:var(--text-light,var(--text-muted));font-size:22px;line-height:1}@media (max-width:767px){.ua-ww-arrow{display:none}}.ua-ww-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:var(--text-sm,12px);color:var(--text-muted)}.ua-ww-ex-note{display:none;color:var(--text-muted)}@keyframes ua-ww-flash{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 var(--primary)}25%{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--primary)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 transparent}}.ua-ww-flash{border-radius:var(--border-radius-md,8px);animation:ua-ww-flash 1.8s ease-out}.grid-empty.ua-ghost-host{display:none}.ua-ghost{padding:6px 0 8px;opacity:.75;font-style:italic;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:var(--text-sm,12px)}.ua-ghost-label{display:inline-block;margin:0 0 4px 12px;padding:0 6px;border-radius:4px;font-style:normal;font-size:11px;background:var(--bg-light-gray,var(--control-bg));color:var(--text-muted)}.ua-ghost-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:5px 12px;border-top:1px dashed var(--border-color)}.ua-ghost-no{flex:0 0 28px;text-align:center;font-style:normal}.ua-ghost-text{flex:1}.ua-ghost-cols>span:nth-child(n+3){flex:0 0 18%}.ua-ghost-tag{font-style:normal;font-size:11px;padding:0 6px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--primary);color:var(--primary)}.ua-ghost-inline{margin-top:4px;font-style:italic;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:var(--text-sm,12px)}</style><div class=\"ua-ww\"><div class=\"ua-ww-steps\"><div class=\"ua-ww-step\" data-target=\"problem_statement\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" title=\"Go to this field\"><div class=\"ua-ww-head\"><span class=\"ua-ww-num\">1</span><span class=\"ua-ww-icon\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 4h6a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1H8V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z\"/><path d=\"M8 5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2\"/><path d=\"M8 12h8M8 16h5\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"ua-ww-title\">Describe</div><div class=\"ua-ww-text\">Write what happened in one line &ndash; <i>what</i>, <i>where</i>, <i>when</i>.</div></div><div class=\"ua-ww-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</div><div class=\"ua-ww-step\" data-target=\"why_why_analysis\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" title=\"Go to this field\"><div class=\"ua-ww-head\"><span class=\"ua-ww-num\">2</span><span class=\"ua-ww-icon\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.5 2.3c-.6.3-1 .9-1 1.6V14\"/><path d=\"M12 17.5h.01\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"ua-ww-title\">Ask &ldquo;why?&rdquo;</div><div class=\"ua-ww-text\">Answer it in row&nbsp;1. Then ask why about <i>that</i> answer and add row&nbsp;2, and so on.</div></div><div class=\"ua-ww-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</div><div class=\"ua-ww-step\" data-target=\"root_cause\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" title=\"Go to this field\"><div class=\"ua-ww-head\"><span class=\"ua-ww-num\">3</span><span class=\"ua-ww-icon\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"ua-ww-title\">Reach the root cause</div><div class=\"ua-ww-text\">Stop when the answer is something you can fix &ndash; usually 3&ndash;5 rows. The last row becomes the <b>Root Cause</b>.</div></div><div class=\"ua-ww-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</div><div class=\"ua-ww-step\" data-target=\"corrective_actions\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" title=\"Go to this field\"><div class=\"ua-ww-head\"><span class=\"ua-ww-num\">4</span><span class=\"ua-ww-icon\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3 8-8\"/><path d=\"M20 12v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"ua-ww-title\">Act on it</div><div class=\"ua-ww-text\">Add actions with an owner and due date. Each owner gets a <b>ToDo</b>.</div></div></div><div class=\"ua-ww-bar\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-xs btn-default ua-ww-ex-toggle\">See an example</button><span class=\"ua-ww-ex-note\">Example text is shown in the fields below &ndash; it is not saved.</span><span class=\"ua-ww-tip\">Tip: click a step to jump to its field.</span></div></div>",
   "owner": "Administrator"
  },
